# Project Structure Rules

## Directory Organization
- All custom apps must reside in the `apps/` directory
- Each app should follow Frappe's standard structure:
  ```
  app_name/
  ├── app_name/
  │   ├── __init__.py
  │   ├── config/
  │   ├── modules/
  │   ├── patches/
  │   └── templates/
  ├── hooks.py
  ├── setup.py
  └── requirements.txt
  ```

## Module Structure
- Each module should be in `app_name/modules/module_name/`
- Module structure:
  ```
  module_name/
  ├── __init__.py
  ├── api.py
  ├── config/
  ├── doctype/
  ├── page/
  ├── report/
  ├── web_form/
  └── workspace/
  ```

## File Organization
- Keep related files together in logical directories
- Use descriptive directory names
- Maintain consistent structure across all apps
